@startuml
title Storyteller Local API Design

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

package "Clients" #E0F2FE {
  [CLI Adapter\nnl.llm.storyteller.cli]
  [Browser Frontend]
}

package "API Adapter\nnl.llm.storyteller.api" #DBEAFE {
  [HTTP Server / Controllers]
  [Request & Response DTOs]
  [Cookie Session Resolver]
  [Session Lifecycle Service]
  [Filesystem Session Store]
  [Story Export Adapter]
}

package "Storyteller Core\nnl.llm.storyteller.core, .core.service, .core.model" #DCFCE7 {
  [StorySessionService]
  [PromptAssemblyService]
  [ResponseGuard]
  [HistoryStore]
  [SummaryManager]
  [RecentSummaryManager]
  [CanonicalStateManager]
  [DerivedMemoryTaskQueue]
  [StoryExportService]
}

package "Model Backend" #FEF3C7 {
  [OpenAI-Compatible\nChat API\n(text + transient images)]
  [Managed llama-server]
  [Managed mlx-vlm server]
}

database "Local session directories\nmemory/sessions/<session-id>/" as SessionFiles
database "CLI local memory\nmemory/" as CliFiles
database "Local GGUF model" as GgufModel
database "Local MLX model" as MlxModel

[Browser Frontend] --> [HTTP Server / Controllers] : HTTP
[HTTP Server / Controllers] --> [Request & Response DTOs]
[HTTP Server / Controllers] --> [Cookie Session Resolver]
[HTTP Server / Controllers] --> [Session Lifecycle Service]
[HTTP Server / Controllers] --> [Story Export Adapter]
[Cookie Session Resolver] --> [Session Lifecycle Service] : opaque cookie reference
[Session Lifecycle Service] --> [Filesystem Session Store]
[Filesystem Session Store] --> SessionFiles
[Session Lifecycle Service] --> [StorySessionService] : turns / reset / undo / projections
[Story Export Adapter] --> [StoryExportService]

[CLI Adapter\nnl.llm.storyteller.cli] --> [StorySessionService]
[CLI Adapter\nnl.llm.storyteller.cli] --> [StoryExportService]
[HistoryStore] --> CliFiles

[StorySessionService] --> [PromptAssemblyService]
[StorySessionService] --> [ResponseGuard]
[StorySessionService] --> [HistoryStore]
[StorySessionService] --> [SummaryManager]
[StorySessionService] --> [RecentSummaryManager]
[StorySessionService] --> [CanonicalStateManager]
[SummaryManager] --> [DerivedMemoryTaskQueue]
[RecentSummaryManager] --> [DerivedMemoryTaskQueue]
[CanonicalStateManager] --> [DerivedMemoryTaskQueue]
[ResponseGuard] --> [OpenAI-Compatible\nChat API\n(text + transient images)]
[StorySessionService] --> [OpenAI-Compatible\nChat API\n(text + transient images)]
[Managed llama-server] --> [OpenAI-Compatible\nChat API\n(text + transient images)] : loopback endpoint
[Managed llama-server] --> GgufModel : load
[Managed mlx-vlm server] --> [OpenAI-Compatible\nChat API\n(text + transient images)] : loopback endpoint
[Managed mlx-vlm server] --> MlxModel : load

note bottom of [Cookie Session Resolver]
Cookie contains only an opaque session reference.
History, prompts, summaries, and state stay on disk.
end note

note bottom of [HTTP Server / Controllers]
The API is an adapter around core behavior.
It does not rebuild prompts, validation,
undo, or derived-memory semantics.
end note

note bottom of [Managed llama-server]
Optional local process lifecycle managed by core.
The same HTTP adapter remains in use.
end note

note bottom of [Managed mlx-vlm server]
Optional local process lifecycle managed by core.
The same HTTP adapter remains in use.
end note

note bottom of [Filesystem Session Store]
Local first: no database required.
Expiry cleanup removes live session directories;
downloaded bundles remain separate.
end note
@enduml
